{
  "_comment": [
    "Every JERICHO mod is its own git repository; core uses no submodules for them.",
    "tools/fetch_mods.py clones a missing mod at `ref` (the commit core was last",
    "built and tested against) and never touches a folder that already exists",
    "unless asked (--update / --advance, clean checkouts only). `branch` is where",
    "that commit is followed; --advance moves to its tip, --pin records HEAD here.",
    "required: the game does not build without it (premake5.lua, jer_required_mods.h).",
    "release: fetched by CI and pre-included in a Release build (JERICHO_RELEASE_MODS).",
    "Everything else is optional: core builds and its checks pass without it."
  ],
